tmp/

# Pilot, dry-run and readiness walks (rounds/r1, rounds/r1d2, rounds/<round>/pilot ...) keep only
# their .md reports in git. Their screenshots and step files go under the main checkout's
# tmp/design-studio/ (see tool/README.md): on 2026-10-21 golden held 83,000 walk screenshots,
# 9.9 GB in Git LFS. Files already tracked are not affected.
**/rounds/r[0-9]*/**
**/rounds/*/pilot/**
**/rounds/pilot/**
!**/rounds/r[0-9]*/**/
!**/rounds/*/pilot/**/
!**/rounds/pilot/**/
!**/rounds/**/*.md

# A round's sessions, expert walkthroughs and repros keep only their .md files in git too; their
# screenshots live under the main checkout's tmp/design-studio/<tier>/rounds/ (owner, 2026-10-21:
# walk screenshots never go into git; the tier 4 round's 1,233 images tripped the image guard).
**/rounds/round-*/sessions/**
**/rounds/round-*/expert/**
**/rounds/round-*/repro/**
!**/rounds/round-*/**/
!**/rounds/**/*.md
!**/rounds/**/*.json
